        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The work presented in this paper takes an alternative view that complete math-",
      "bbox": [
        133.76803588867188,
        527.85400390625,
        477.4976806640625,
        536.7008056640625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ematical models of hybrid systems are unavailable. Instead, the available system",
      "bbox": [
        133.76803588867188,
        539.092041015625,
        477.48773193359375,
        547.9388427734375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "description combines a black-box simulator and a white-box transition graph.",
      "bbox": [
        133.76803588867188,
        550.330078125,
        477.5274963378906,
        559.1768798828125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Starting from this point of view, we have developed the semantic framework,",
      "bbox": [
        133.76803588867188,
        561.5680541992188,
        477.5176086425781,
        570.4148559570312
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "a probabilistic veriﬁcation algorithm, and results on simulation relations and",
      "bbox": [
        133.76803588867188,
        572.8060302734375,
        477.5475158691406,
        581.65283203125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "sequential composition for reasoning about complex hybrid systems over long",
      "bbox": [
        133.76803588867188,
        584.0440673828125,
        477.5076599121094,
        592.890869140625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "switching sequences. Through modeling and analysis of a number of automo-",
      "bbox": [
        133.76803588867188,
        595.2810668945312,
        477.517578125,
        604.1278686523438
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "tive control systems using implementations of the proposed approach, we hope",
      "bbox": [
        133.76803588867188,
        606.51904296875,
        477.4977722167969,
        615.3658447265625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "to have demonstrated their promise. One direction for further exploration in",
      "bbox": [
